tionNode","statementID":"1422117005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"洛尔迪，我答应你，我愿意成为你的爱人！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1422117006:0":{"key":"say:12:1422117006:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1422117006","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"艾莎……！你真的愿意？！你不介意那些阻挡着我们的东西了吗？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1422117007:1":{"key":"say:13:1422117007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1422117007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……介意，但是我知道，我们都要诚实地面对自己！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1422117008:1":{"key":"say:14:1422117008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1422117008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"以戒指为证，我们永不遗忘，永不逃避，永不背叛……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:17:1422117009:0":{"key":"say:17:1422117009:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"17","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1422117009","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice